---
import {catalog,topicMethods} from '../../../lib/oscp';
import supplemental from '../../../content/oscp-supplemental.json';
import {createMarkdownProcessor} from '@astrojs/markdown-remark';
const processor=await createMarkdownProcessor({syntaxHighlight:false});
const methods=(await Promise.all(catalog.topics.map(t=>topicMethods(t.id)))).flat();
const supplements=await Promise.all(supplemental.map(async s=>({...s,html:(await processor.render(s.markdown)).code})));
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Investigation workspace — OSCP Reference</title></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#investigations">Skip to investigations</a>
<header><a href="/oscp/">OSCP Reference</a><label class="search">Find a surface, command or clue <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search all investigations…"/></label><a href="/oscp/">Full library</a></header>
<section class="context" aria-label="Current context"><label>Host <select id="host"></select></label><button id="add-host">Add host</button><label>Identity <input id="identity" maxlength="120" placeholder="Current account / unknown"/></label><label>Source <input id="source" maxlength="120" placeholder="Kali / Windows shell / pivot"/></label><button id="export">Export session</button><label class="import">Import <input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json"/></label><span id="notice" role="status">Session stays in this tab; export to keep it.</span></section>
<div class="layout"><aside><h2>Investigate</h2><nav aria-label="Investigation topics"><button data-topic="all" aria-current="page">All surfaces</button>{catalog.topics.map(t=><button data-topic={t.id}>{t.title}</button>)}</nav><hr/><button id="show-path">My recorded path</button><p>Opening a check does not record a finding. Choose the outcome supported by your evidence.</p></aside>
<main id="investigations"><h1 id="topic-title">Attack-surface investigations</h1><p>Choose a surface, inspect its output, then follow the missing prerequisite.</p><section id="suggestions"><h2>Suggested next checks</h2><div id="suggestion-list">Open a surface below to begin.</div></section><div class="filters"><label>Show <select id="filter"><option value="all">All coverage</option><option>Not inspected</option><option>Candidate found</option><option>Prerequisite tested</option><option>Capability verified</option><option>Denied here</option><option>Inconclusive</option><option>Revisit</option></select></label><span id="count" role="status"></span><button id="collapse">Collapse sections</button></div>
{catalog.topics.map(t=><section class="topic" data-group={t.id}><h2>{t.title}</h2>{methods.filter(m=>m.topic===t.id).map(m=><details class="surface" id={m.id} data-topic={t.id} data-search={m.search}><summary><strong>{m.title}</strong><span class="badge">Not inspected</span><small>{m.clue}</small></summary><div class="inside"><p><strong>Starting access:</strong> {m.access}</p><div class="pair"><div><h3>Discover the clue</h3><div set:html={m.html.discovery}/></div><div><h3>Read the result</h3><p>{m.recognition.spot}</p><p><strong>Still check:</strong> {m.recognition.confirm}</p><details><summary>Illustrative output</summary><pre>{m.recognition.sample}</pre></details></div></div><details><summary>Validate prerequisites and compare methods</summary><p>{m.conditions}</p><div set:html={m.html.checks}/><a href={'/oscp/notes/methods/'+m.topic+'/#'+m.id}>Open numbered procedure and alternatives →</a></details><div class="outcomes"><h3>What did you find?</h3><p><strong>Enabled:</strong> {m.recognition.enabled}</p><p><strong>Ruled out here:</strong> {m.recognition.ruledout}</p><p><strong>Unresolved:</strong> {m.recognition.unknown}</p></div><label>Record coverage <select data-status><option>Not inspected</option><option>Candidate found</option><option>Prerequisite tested</option><option>Capability verified</option><option>Denied here</option><option>Inconclusive</option><option>Revisit</option></select></label><details><summary>Show connections</summary><p>These are conditional possibilities. Check the named condition before moving.</p>{m.next.map(n=><p><a href={'#'+n.id}>{catalog.methods.find(x=>x.id===n.id)?.title||n.id}</a> — {n.when}<br/><strong>Requires:</strong> {n.requires}</p>)}</details></div></details>)}{supplements.filter(s=>s.topic===t.id).map(s=><details class="surface" id={s.id} data-topic={s.topic} data-search={s.markdown}><summary><strong>{s.id} · {s.title}</strong><span class="badge">Not inspected</span>{s.discoveryOnly&&<small class="limit">Discovery / validation only · action procedure pending</small>}</summary><div class="inside"><div set:html={s.html}/><label>Record coverage <select data-status><option>Not inspected</option><option>Candidate found</option><option>Prerequisite tested</option><option>Capability verified</option><option>Denied here</option><option>Inconclusive</option><option>Revisit</option></select></label></div></details>)}</section>)}
<p id="empty" hidden>No matching surfaces. Clear the search or change the coverage filter.</p></main><aside class="path"><h2>My recorded path</h2><p>For the selected host. Entries reflect outcomes you selected.</p><ol id="history"></ol></aside></div>
<noscript>This workspace needs JavaScript for filters and session tracking. <a href="/oscp/">Use the full reference.</a></noscript>
</body></html>
<script>import '../../../scripts/oscp-investigator';</script>
<style is:global>@import '../../../styles/oscp-investigator.css';</style>
